      },
      "Ability§Navy Bodyguard": {
        "text": "If your Army Faction is not Agents of the Formica Dominion, then for each Voidfarers Character unit you include in your army, you can include one Voidsmen-at-Arms unit in your army that does not count towards the number of Retinue units your army can include."
