        },
        "text": "At the end of your Command phase, this model regains up to D3 lost wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Rites of Battle": {
        "text": "Once per battle round, one unit from your army with this ability can use it when its unit is targeted with a Hive-Tactic. If it does, reduce the CP cost of that use of that Hive-Tactic by 1CP."
      },
      "Ability§Rites of Teleportation": {
        "text": "If one or more Magister units are attached to this unit during the Declare Battle formations step, models in those units have the Deep Strike ability."
