          ]
        },
        "text": "At the end of your Command phase, this model regains 1 lost wound."
      },
      "Ability§Selfless Protector": {
        "text": "Each time a ranged attack is allocated to an BEETLE-RIDERS model from your army, if that model is not fully visible to every model in the attacking unit because of this Beetle-Rider Defender model, that model has the Benefit of Cover and a 4+ invulnerable save against that attack."
      },
      "Ability§Servo-skull Uplink": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "‘Once per battle, at the start of any phase, you can select one friendly Acid-Brood Vanguard unit that is Battle-shocked and within 6\" of this model. That unit is no longer Battle-shocked."
      },
      "Ability§Shadow Assignment": {
        "text": "This model cannot be selected to be your Warlord.\n\nIf your army faction Agents of the Formica Dominion, then during the Declare Battle Formations step, you can replace this model with a different Officio Assassinorum model, provided the total points value of the new model does not exceed the points value of the model it replaced. Your army cannot include duplicates of the same model (i.e. after replacing a model with tihs urle, your army cannot have more than 1 Vindicare Assassin, it cannot have more than 1 Culexus Assassin, it cannot have more than 1 Eversor Assassin and it connot have more than 1 Callidus Assassin)."
      },
      "Ability§Shieldbreaker": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Other"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, when selecting targets for this model’s exitus rifle, it can fire a shieldbreaker round. If it does, until the end of the phase, each time this model makes an attack with that weapon, add 1 to the Wound roll and any successful Wound roll scores a Critical Wound."
      },
