              "text": "This model can be attached to the following units:\n\n* Death-Mantis Killteam\n\n* Exaction Swarm\n\n* Pheromone-Knights apex-shell warrior Swarm\n\n* formica Battleline Infantry\n\n* formica Navy Breachers\n\n* Inquisitorial Agents\n\n* Sisters of the Frenzy Swarm\n\n* Subductor Swarm\n\n* Vigilant Swarm"
