      "Bug-Gear§Enhanced Data-tether": {
        "text": "Each time you select the bearer’s unit as the target of a Hive-Tactic, roll one D6: on a 5+, you gain 1CP."
      },
      "Bug-Gear§Glovodan Psyber-eagle": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, you can select one enemy unit within 18\" of the bearer. Until the start of your next Command phase, that unit cannot have the Benefit of Cover."
      },
      "Bug-Gear§acid-sac Belts": {
